    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 10, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "content": "### 🔗 Kafka 端到端分散式鏈路追蹤 (W3C TraceContext)\n\n本專案示範了標準雲原生 Kafka 訊息鏈路傳播：\n\n1. **生產端 (Producer)**：API 建立訂單時注入 W3C `traceparent` Header 到 Kafka 訊息中，並產生 `KafkaProduce:orders.events` Span。\n2. **消費端 (Consumer)**：背景 `OrderProcessingConsumer` 提取 `traceparent`，建立子 Span `KafkaConsume:orders.events`。\n3. **跨行程關聯**：在 VictoriaTraces 中可直接檢視從 HTTP 請求 ➔ Kafka 發布 ➔ 非同步消費的完整樹狀圖！\n\n👉 **[前往 VictoriaTraces 檢索鏈路](http://localhost:10428/select/vmui)**",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Kafka 分散式鏈路追蹤架構",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "victorialogs" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 14, "x": 10, "y": 17 },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "showLabels": false,
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
